On available
    Say "You've all sealed 71 Devils. There's one last one. Visit Seis to receive the last mission."

On offer
    Show quest "Finally the victory is not far away. It's all because of you, <selfname>.\n\nThis is the final stage. Only the most colossal enemy remains. That is [Devil 1] Demon King Bael. He is the Demon King who rules the East, commanding 66 legions and a master of swordsmanship, reigning supreme as the 1st in rank among all demons. To end this Demon War, you must seal him. Take the [Devil 1 Lord Summoning Scroll] I gave you and find the [Devil 1 Summoning Stone] here in [Ronark Land]. Then, summon him and settle the score. I wish you luck. Bring this war to an end.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 1 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Bros, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 1] Bael from [Devil 1 Summoning Stone] at Luferson Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 1 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "There's still the [Devil1] Bael's Army."

On claimable
    Show quest "Good job! War will end now. Thank you.\n\nDo you remember the monk [Order of the Sorcery Leader] Malraseu? He wants to see you, <selfname>. He wants to award you, probably. He'll also tell you how we can forever seal the Devils."
